{"3826370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Headquarters: Cold War", "steam_appid": 3826370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4661170, 4450200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headquarters: Cold War is a fast-paced turn-based strategy game set in a hypothetical conflict between NATO and the USSR in 1984. Commanders can play as either side across two plot-driven campaigns and a variety of skirmish missions. Build your force, assign heroes, level up units, and use powerful Headquarters skills to outsmart the enemy and change the course of modern history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face a true tactical challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system follows the easy to learn, hard to master philosophy, offering depth and realism with every decision:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units feature detailed armor (front, side, back, top) where positioning is critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain and obstacles provide directional cover and shape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyed vehicles and buildings create new tactical opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High ground and destructible environments add verticality and unpredictability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/29565c866d747aee87e2c5ae867f5447.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/29565c866d747aee87e2c5ae867f5447.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/29565c866d747aee87e2c5ae867f5447.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recon. Plan. Execute.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See both sides of the story</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two full campaigns with 10 missions each, for a total of 20 story-driven operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six Skirmish maps designed for replayability and tactical variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >58 highly detailed unit models and a wide range of 3D environment assets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersing atmosphere with 12 original music tracks, with high quality sound effects that heighten immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play unique Unit classes: Utility and Attack helicopters. Take command of the first airborne units in the series, capable of transporting infantry, delivering pinpoint strikes, and dominating the battlefield with unmatched mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New HQ skills: adding devastating new abilities such as Resupply, MLRS, Air Strike, and even a Tactical Nuke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new Officer skill trees, offering powerful abilities like Close Quarters Battle, Field Interrogation, Camo Net, Modular Armor Panels, Enhanced Radar Systems, and more to customize your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced Cold War-era gameplay, with increased movement and attack ranges that reflect modern technology while keeping the tactical depth you expect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and share your own battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game Map Editor lets you design custom skirmish and multiplayer maps from the ground up. Shape the terrain, place objectives, and craft unique tactical scenarios to challenge yourself and others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, upgrade and customize your units. Assign heroes with unique skills, level up troops, and adapt your force composition to overcome every scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/50548fbbf88fa83e8614dac3b47ee44d.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/50548fbbf88fa83e8614dac3b47ee44d.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/50548fbbf88fa83e8614dac3b47ee44d.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep your crews safe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit has a crew, and each member matters. Lose a gunner and firepower drops; lose a driver and mobility suffers. Protect your crews if you want to maintain combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaigns and multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through two campaigns (NATO and USSR) with 10 missions each, test your tactics in Skirmish battles against improved AI, or challenge friends in online multiplayer with up to 4 players. Cooperative 2v2 battles are supported, along with asynchronous play through Slitherine’s CombatHQ system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headquarters: Cold War is a fast-paced turn-based strategy game set in a hypothetical conflict between NATO and the USSR in 1984. Commanders can play as either side across two plot-driven campaigns and a variety of skirmish missions. Build your force, assign heroes, level up units, and use powerful Headquarters skills to outsmart the enemy and change the course of modern history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face a true tactical challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system follows the easy to learn, hard to master philosophy, offering depth and realism with every decision:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units feature detailed armor (front, side, back, top) where positioning is critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain and obstacles provide directional cover and shape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyed vehicles and buildings create new tactical opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High gr