Radar Systems, and more to customize your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced Cold War-era gameplay, with increased movement and attack ranges that reflect modern technology while keeping the tactical depth you expect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/6aabd596ca406f724c8f874903cf5e47.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create and share your own battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game Map Editor lets you design custom skirmish and multiplayer maps from the ground up. Shape the terrain, place objectives, and craft unique tactical scenarios to challenge yourself and others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.poster.avif?t=1785846202\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.webm?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826370/extras/e3f8af7057d2952aa9600ec4fe72a379.mp4?t=1785846202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage 